<abstract>
The GGL Common Library was developed at the Geodesy and Geodynamics
Laboratory of the Institute of Geodesy and Photogrammetry at the
Swiss Federal Institute of Technology in Zurich.
It was designed to meet the need of useful library functions while
programming scientific calculation and data processing software.
</abstract>

